[Strings]
\s\sMB = \s\sMB
\sType of object determination, lowering Max its or increasing DE\n(dependend on the choosen option), will make the object thicker.\nNote:  DEcombinate formulas work only in the Distance estimation mode! = \s对象判定方式。降低 Max its 或增大 DE\n（取决于所选选项）会使对象变厚。\n注意：  DEcombinate 公式仅在距离估计模式下有效！
&Basic colors: = 基本颜色(&B)：
&Open = 打开(&O)
&Save = 保存(&S)
&Select = 选择(&S)
..til next update = ..距下次更新
1:  Full size, no anti aliasing\n2:  2x2 anti aliasing\n3:  3x3 anti aliasing = 1:  全尺寸，无抗锯齿\n2:  2x2 抗锯齿\n3:  3x3 抗锯齿
1:  none\n2:  2x2\n3:  3x3 = 1:  无\n2:  2x2\n3:  3x3
Abort = 中止
Absolute distance of the smooth combine functions,\nyou can use scientific notation like 3e-5 for small values.\nTry 1/zoom to get close to a working value. = 平滑组合函数的绝对距离，\n小数值可使用科学记数法，如 3e-5。\n可尝试 1/缩放 以接近可用的值。
All files (*.*) = 所有文件 (*.*)
Box: sharp, good AA\nGauss: bit blurry, very good AA = Box：锐利，抗锯齿良好\nGauss：略微模糊，抗锯齿极佳
Calculate 3D = 计算 3D
Calculate preview = 计算预览
Calculate the image first. = 请先计算图像。
Calculated on the CPU = 在 CPU 上计算
Calculated on: {} = 计算于：{}
Cancel = 取消
Cannot write {}: {} = 无法写入 {}：{}
Click a parameter file for its preview. = 点击参数文件可查看其预览。
Click on image = 点击图像
Co: = Co:
Code: {}\nFile: {} = 代码：{}\n文件：{}
Color = 颜色
Color Option:\n0:  Average of both formulas.\n1:  Color of first formula.\n2:  Color of second formula. = 颜色选项：\n0:  两个公式的平均值。\n1:  第一个公式的颜色。\n2:  第二个公式的颜色。
Combination Methods:\nMin: Both fractals are visible, minimum combine the DE's\nMax: Only overlapping parts, maximum combine the DE's\nInv max: Invert DE of second Hybrid and combine 'Max'\nMin lin: Minimum combine with a linear overlap function\nMin nlin: Like S1, nonlinear function, more smooth overlap\nMix: First F1..FendHybrid1 then use FstartHybrid2..F6 (dIFS) with modified vector. = 组合方法：\nMin：两个分形都可见，取 DE 的最小值组合\nMax：仅保留重叠部分，取 DE 的最大值组合\nInv max：反转第二个 Hybrid 的 DE 并按 'Max' 组合\nMin lin：用线性重叠函数取最小值组合\nMin nlin：类似 S1，非线性函数，重叠更平滑\nMix：先用 F1..FendHybrid1，再以修改后的向量使用 FstartHybrid2..F6 (dIFS)。
Defines how accurate the position with the defined distance to the surface will be calculated.\nHigher values leads to more accuracy what leads also to a better normals calculation.\nMuch more than 12 are rarely needed. = 定义到表面指定距离处的位置计算得有多精确。\n值越高精度越高，法线计算也随之更好。\n很少需要远超过 12 的值。
Depth of reflections: 1 to see only one reflection,\nwith 2 you could see reflections in the reflected object, ... and so on. = 反射深度：1 只能看到一次反射，\n2 则可在被反射的物体中再看到反射，……依此类推。
Divides the actual "Raystep multiplier" by this value,\nincrease the value to reduce overstepping. = 将实际的"Raystep multiplier"（光线步长倍数）除以此值，\n增大该值可减少过步。
Ds: = Ds:
Dyn. fog on It.: = 动态雾迭代：
Dynamic fog:\nThe lower the number the farer away from the object the fog shows up.\nWith dIFS, the fog is around the object part calculated at this iteration.\nZero to disable this feature and do the dynamic fog on raystep count as usual.\nHint: Check the 'First step random' option to prevent steps.\nVolumetric light:\nChoose the light nr from which lightscattering will be calculated. = 动态雾：\n数值越低，雾出现的位置离对象越远。\n使用 dIFS 时，雾围绕在该迭代计算出的对象部分周围。\n设为零可禁用此功能，照常按光线步数计算动态雾。\n提示：勾选"First step random"（首步随机）选项可避免出现台阶。\n体积光：\n选择用于计算光散射的光源编号。
File &name: = 文件名(&N)：
Files of &type: = 文件类型(&T)：
Get Z1 = 获取 Z1
Get Z2 = 获取 Z2
Get min.dist. from image = 从图像获取最小距离
Get values from image = 从图像获取数值
HiQual 1 = HiQual 1
If set to a higher value than 0, the surface normals will be calculated with an average\nof distributed points and a roughness factor is calculated too, resulting in lower aliasing.\nA value of 8 will average over a volume, what is very slow but can be used in very\ncritical situations.  You could also use the Normals on ZBuf in postprocessings. = 若设为大于 0 的值，表面法线将用分布点的平均值计算，\n并同时计算粗糙度系数，从而减少锯齿。\n值为 8 时将对一个体积取平均，非常慢，但可用于极其\n苛刻的情况。  您也可以在后期处理中使用 Normals on ZBuf。
Ignore = 忽略
Interface language: {} (click to change) = 界面语言：{}（点击更改）
Iterations: = 迭代次数：
Look &in: = 查找范围(&I)：
Making the video... = 正在生成视频...
No = 否
OK = 确定
Open = 打开
Panorama mode:\n- The FOV is choosen automatically\n- Use the 24bit SSAO or DEAO for ambient shadows\n- A 2:1 aspect ratio is recommended, but not necessary. = 全景模式：\n- FOV 自动选取\n- 使用 24 位 SSAO 或 DEAO 产生环境阴影\n- 推荐 2:1 的宽高比，但并非必须。
Pause rendering = 暂停渲染
Paused, press to continue = 已暂停，按下以继续
Press 'Calculate 3D' to render = 按"计算 3D"开始渲染
Retry = 重试
Sart the main rendering of the image. = 开始图像的主渲染。
Save As = 另存为
Sharpen factor of the saved output image,\nworks only with downscales of 1:2 and 1:3 !\n0: no sharpening ... 3: maximum sharpening = 保存的输出图像的锐化系数，\n仅在 1:2 和 1:3 缩小时有效！\n0：不锐化 ... 3：最大锐化
Start batch rendering = 开始批量渲染
Start rendering = 开始渲染
Start rendering animation images = 开始渲染动画图像
Stop = 停止
Stop batch rendering = 停止批量渲染
Stop rendering = 停止渲染
Stop rendering the animation. = 停止渲染动画。
Stop the current calculation. = 停止当前计算。
Stopping... = 正在停止...
There is a file {} already. = 文件 {} 已存在。
Tracing object... = 正在跟踪对象...
Type the name of the new language first; it is the name of its file. = 请先输入新语言的名称；它将作为其文件名。
Up one level = 向上一级
Volume light nr: = 体积光编号：
Weight: = 权重：
Written: {}\nTranslate the texts right of the "\=" with a text editor, then press Reload. = 已写入：{}\n请用文本编辑器翻译 "=" 右侧的文本，然后按"重新加载"。
Yes = 是
